# FORK DIVERGENCE: upstream ignores /dist/ because it is built at publish time.
# This fork is consumed directly from the working tree via `link:` in the app's
# package.json, so the built output is committed — otherwise a fresh clone would
# have to install this package's devDependencies before the app could build.
# Rebuild with `node build.mjs` after touching src/, and drop this hunk when
# upstreaming.

